      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this has affected myself, and some of my friends as well including someone who doesn't own any Oculus hardware of any kind. Sometimes the bug can last for the entire day, or numerous restarts. Users with the quest tag are unable to join PC only worlds, they can't get invites to PC worlds, and the game displays them as \"Quest\" on the nameplate. We were able to get someone with this Quest tag to join a PC world by going to them, and dropping a portal to a PC world, at which point the game allowed them in. However, inviting them directly just gave the error saying they were on the wrong platform.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
