      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The bug is still there, I'm always playing on Desktop/ VR on PC, I wonder how we can miss such a thing? How the game can not tell the difference between a player launching the game by PC and by Oculus Quest ?",
      "viewerReactions": null
