      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5dcae10f2fb049260da562f6|full_name}: If this still is happening, which the post by Unidelta seems to imply it may be, when it occurred in the past, it happened to people who:\nDon't own a quest\nDon't even have unity\nDon't make quest content at all\nSo that kinda would imply it's not tied to that. I personally don't see how that would affect it in game either and seems like some form of API issue but I dunno. Purely speculation, if this can be replicated in some form that you're aware of, you should follow up with further documentation on replication.",
