  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "[1027] With new VRChat client update, sometimes there is strange bug: VRC thinks i am Quest user (basically i received Quest flag) means i cannot join friend if he is in PC-only world.\nI can join friend if he is in Quest compatible world.\nBut i am PC user all time. So why this message? Probably a bug. I can join worlds directly if they are PC-only, but i cannot join any friend if they are in PC-only world.\n\nThe problems lucky not stays all time, today (next day) i can join without friends even they're in PC-only world.\nSo, why does this bug happens sometimes? It's annoying problem. I even restarted VRChat, same problem. But it is gone next day or perhaps after some hours. So it's small bug that just happens sometimes.\n\nCan you take a look in this bug, and make code more solid to check between pc and quest?",
